## 10. Before you publish this anywhere

Search the project for `PLACEHOLDER` (your editor's find-in-files, or `grep -rn PLACEHOLDER
src/` in a terminal) — every hit is sample data that needs your real details:

- `profile.email`, `profile.linkedin`, and the rest of `profile.socials`
- Certifications (issuer names, years, status)
- Employer name/dates for the second (older) job entry
- Education (university name, dates)
- Some project result metrics are illustrative ("~60%") — replace with real numbers once
  you have them, or soften the wording if you don't want to commit to a specific figure
- Add your actual PDF at `public/resume.pdf` — the Resume button already links there

