## 11. Deployment

```bash
npm run build
```
produces a `dist/` folder containing the fully static site — plain HTML/CSS/JS, no server
required. Drag-and-drop `dist/` onto [Netlify](https://app.netlify.com/drop), or connect the
project's Git repo to [Vercel](https://vercel.com) or [GitHub Pages](https://pages.github.com)
and point the build command at `npm run build` with `dist` as the output directory.

