## 12. Troubleshooting

**"npm install" fails / package errors** — make sure you have Node.js 18 or newer
(`node -v`), and try deleting `node_modules` and `package-lock.json` and running `npm
install` again.

**A section doesn't scroll to correctly from the nav** — check that the `id` in `navLinks`
(in `content.js`) exactly matches the `id="..."` on that section's `<section>` tag in its
`.jsx` file.

**The hero looks broken / shows a solid color with no character** — this almost always means
the 65 files in `public/frames/` didn't get copied/deployed. Check they exist and that
`vite.config.js`/your host isn't excluding the `public/` folder.

**I edited `content.js` and nothing changed** — make sure the dev server is still running
(`npm run dev`) and check the browser console for a red error — a missing comma or an
unclosed `{` in `content.js` will stop the whole file from loading.